From 049067cb23eac1822fecdbc558ca5f31fc231982 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seyoon Ragavan <complexzetaprime@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:15:14 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 37/37] gate52 r1 minors: G52-01..05, 07..09

G52-01/02/07: disclose the computable rational-parameter version and the unproved arbitrary-real bridge; state the integer-log/natural-division formula; remove campaign labels while preserving Dv tags.
G52-03: make both inverse schedules public PadQuad.nu aliases and keep their public readers via PadQuad.nu_eq. Existing inverse proofs already use the public API.
G52-04/05: retain the five paired equivalence families and the existing padding/OneWay probability imports; the checkpoint report records the consolidation plan and neutral-home promotion requests.
G52-08/09: the checkpoint report is rewritten against this source head; replace all nineteen facade placeholders without changing exports.

All 670 frozen headers and public readers are preserved. Twenty-four statement-prose changes are explicitly authorized by the received Gate52 ruling and hash-bound in local evidence. The M6 bodies were committed separately.

Move two existing encoding-reader rewrites to the final pointwise M6 sampler equation, removing the full-build unused-simp warnings without changing a statement or witness.
